{"articleNo":"2301","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2301&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"★2009-2학기 생활관 선착순 입사 신청 안내 - ●일정변경●","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.08.11","hit":"22484","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2009-2학기 생활관 선착순 입사 신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"635\" height=\"66\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">생활관 입사를 희망하는 학생은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">신청전에</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> 휴대폰 번호를 학적부에 변경하여 학교에서 보내는 문자를 받을 수 있도록 협조하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">생활관 환불자 및 중도 퇴사자로 인해 남을 여석에 대비하여 선착순 모집을 아래와 같이 실시하오니 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">1. 선착순 신청 일시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ●</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"> BTL 생활관 : 2009. 8. 19(수) 10:00 ～ 11:00<font color=\"#ff0000\">에서<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2009. 8. 24(월) 10:00 - 11:00 변경</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;●&nbsp;기존생활관 : 2009. 8. 20(목) 10:00 ～ 11:00<font color=\"#ff0000\">에서</font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <font color=\"#ff0000\">2009. 8. 25(화) 10:00 - 11:00 변경<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#0000ff\">※ 변경사유 : 2학기 수강신청기간과 중복됨으로 접속시간 지연 해소<br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2. 선착순 신청 대상자 : 학부 재학생 및 복학생</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">기존생활관은 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">구미지역 제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">3. 선착순 모집 인원 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">남○명 여○명(잔여석)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">4. 선착순 신청 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">홈페이지(www.kumoh.ac.kr) 원스톱서비스</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">5. 합격자 발표 : 남는 여석에 따라 신청 접수순으로 합격자에게 개별통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">다른 의문사항이 있으시면&nbsp;BTL생활관은(054-478-7941) 기존생활관은(054-478-7270)으로 문의 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">2009. 08. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;\">금오공과대학교생활관장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
